{"ref":"BDB, יַרְמוּת","hw":"יַרְמוּת","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַרְמוּת</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  𝔊 Ιερ(ε)ιμουθ, Canaanitish city, with a king, named between Hebron and Lachish <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:3\" href=\"/Joshua.10.3\">Jos 10:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:5\" href=\"/Joshua.10.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:23\" href=\"/Joshua.10.23\">23</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:11\" href=\"/Joshua.12.11\">12:11</a> (D); named with Adullam <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:35\" href=\"/Joshua.15.35\">15:35</a> (P), cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.29\">Ne 11:29</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  𝔊 Ρεμμαθ, A 𝔊L Ιερμωθ, Levitical city in Issachar <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:29\" href=\"/Joshua.21.29\">Jos 21:29</a> (P). see <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, רָ(א)מוֹת\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_רָ(א)מוֹת\">רָ)א(מוֹת</a> <strong>1 c,</strong> p. 928b.","next":"BDB, יְרֵמַי","prev":"BDB, יַרְכָה"}